    "verdict": "DEFINITIONAL_NOT_BUG: D0.1 (70.5% OTE fib) and D0.2 (earliest discount/premium FVG) are alternative entry styles per Ep 38. Earliest eligible FVG sits near displacement start (discount for longs); 70.5% OTE sits in premium half (~70% up the leg). Opposite PD halves + leg-scale mismatch explain ~100% conflict. NOT fixable by window tweak alone \u2014 requires operator choice: OTE-only, FVG-only, or unified rule (e.g. FVG nearest OTE / FVG containing OTE)."
  },
